  "body": "Perched near the crest of a peaceful ridgeline, this beautifully reimagined four-bedroom residence delivers an exceptional blend of space, sophistication, and serenity. Thoughtfully designed across two levels, the home features two generous primary bedroom suites, \"each with its own large, fully tiled ensuite\", offering flexibility for extended family living, guests, or a private retreat downstairs complete with its own patio.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a stunning contemporary kitchen anchors the living space. A large central island, double ovens, ceramic hobs, new dishwasher, and rangehood are complemented by abundant cabinetry and a well-appointed walk-in butler's pantry, perfect for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe main bathroom is a true showpiece, boasting a luxurious tiled finish, dual vanity, open shower, and a striking standalone bath designed for relaxation.\r\n\r\nThe expansive living area is enhanced by a vaulted ceiling, creating light, volume, and architectural interest, while seamless flow to a large alfresco deck invites you to unwind and entertain against a backdrop of sweeping elevated views across rolling hills to Rangitoto Island and a glimpse of the sea. \r\n\r\nComfort and practicality are assured with a home ventilation (HMV) system and an internal, spacious combined garage/workshop featuring high-quality kitchen-style benches, cupboards, and extensive storage.\r\n\r\nSet on a private exclusive right of way, the property enjoys total seclusion, surrounded by established native flora including two magnificent Kauri trees, Pohutukawa, cabbage trees, pungas, and lush ferns. Facing east, the home welcomes the morning sun while remaining naturally sheltered. Positioning provides optimum drainage for protection in times of inclement weather. \r\n\r\nLocation is key, \"just a short walk to Browns Bay Beach and local shops, within easy reach of quality schools including Northcross Intermediate, and only minutes by car to Albany's retail and service hub. Commuting is effortless with quick access to the Northern Motorway, connecting you to the CBD or the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nLovingly held by a family member for 17 years, this home has undergone a comprehensive, high-quality renovation and major extensions. All work has been fully consented with codes of compliance issued, ensuring peace of mind for the next owner.\r\n\r\nA rare offering that combines privacy, position, and premium living \"this is a home that truly stands apart.\r\n\r\nOriginal Home Built circa 1979 and major extensions and upgrades completed 2019.\r\n\r\nBoundaries have been marked and flagged by Surveyor. \r\n\r\nNO AGENTS PLEASE APART FROM THOSE THAT HAVE A WRITTEN  BUYER AGENCY\r\n\r\nLand Area: 931 sqm\r\nAuckland Council Recorded Floor Area: 174 sqm \r\n\r\nAvailable to genuinely interested parties:\r\nRecent LIM report\r\nProperty File\r\nExpressions of Interest Form\r\nSurvey Plans\r\n\r\nMore photographs available and 3D Walkthrough at: \r\nhttps://www.nz.open2view.com/properties/607071 \r\n\r\nCall the owner Andrena on 0226961746 for detailed property information or to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTo book a viewing, contact the owner directly, view documents or find out more copy and paste to the following link in your browser: listed.co.nz/P5251",
